---
layout: none
---
{% comment %}
  Secret posts are listed here on purpose, password and all, and the password
  is checked in the browser. That is decorative by design, not a mistake: this
  is a static site, so anyone who opens this file or reads the source sees both
  the URL and the password. The point is the easter egg, not access control.
  Anything that genuinely must not be read should not be published at all.
{% endcomment %}[
  {% for post in site.posts %}
    {
      "title"    : "{{ post.title | escape }}",
      "category" : "{{ post.category }}",
      "tags"     : "{{ post.tags | join: ', ' }}",
      "url"      : "{{ site.baseurl }}{{ post.url }}",
      "date"     : "{{ post.date }}",
      "secret"   : {{ post.secret | default: false }},
      "password" : {{ post.password | jsonify }}
    } {% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
  {% endfor %}
]
